      "title": "epan: fix memory leaks in column format and SRT table filter parsing",
      "message": "epan: fix memory leaks in column format and SRT table filter parsing\n\nIn parse_column_format(), col_custom_fields was allocated using g_strdup() when cust_format_info->len > 0, but was not freed if occurrence parsing failed, leaking memory on invalid column formats.\n\nIn srt_table_get_filter(), cmd_str was allocated using srt_table_get_tap_string(), but was not freed before an early return when srt->param_cb() returned an error, leaking memory on invalid tap options.\n\nAdd missing g_free() calls on error return paths in both functions to prevent heap memory leaks.\n",
      "author_name": "Ayush Meel",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-09-10T23:56:26.000+05:30",
      "committer_name": "Ayush Meel",
